== Trivia ==
*'''Finnegan''' first joined a [[Mayor Election]] in year 241.
*'''Finnegan''' is {{NPCSprite|Jacob}}'s brother-in-law and {{NPCSprite|Trevor the Trapper}}'s cousin.
**This implies that either Jacob, or Finnegan or both of them are married, and that Finnegan and Trevor share grandparents.
*'''Finnegan''''s skin seems to have been created by a skyblock player called {{RN|mvp++|Zelenuk_}}<ref>https://namemc.com/skin/927052012416c9be</ref><ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/they-added-my-skin-to-the-skyblock-hub.6149835</ref><ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20260906160549/https://hypixel.net/threads/they-added-my-skin-to-the-skyblock-hub.6149835/</ref>

